      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9e643739db9a7e9c41b4d79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来吧，训练员！\n再来跑一趟！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af590a80f33f819534b173c1ca690ecdf95ea3ba9a67c88481b9421485943bb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a633c9c4a942e4d3d6dd65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那毫不妥协，将自己逼到极限的态度。\n其中的意志实在值得赞赏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86b636fef95fac5ceea812825ff15ce775ec84a74d7e2866ef27b3c502fe1ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc28d84fb8b3393b59280ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甚至令我期待她在出道战中，\n将力量展现在世人面前的那一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5683d6ed0a766557c5808c3899787a094c8a2f4c7dc4923dbf0f6fa4f746ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4fbf7e65de56316c136812c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是这样没错……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e682a422cd950e9ec7c28329d61388917e41db2094887ece419faf4568d3d48c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
